{
  "title": "allow/deny 白名单外直接 403",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "note", "s": "allow 10.99.0.0/16 + deny all，本机不在白名单"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" -u $u $url"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "403"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "error.log: access forbidden by rule"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "到不了认证环节，对话框都不会出现"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5（nginx:alpine 容器）"}
  ]
}
